  "slide_notes": [
    {
      "slide": 1,
      "title": "葡萄膜炎三分类：四类方法与实验结果",
      "sources": "来源：README.md；results/vitb_320/baseline/comparison.json；milestone1/2 的 selection_before_test.json 和 primary/metrics.json。全部结果为既有汇总，无新增模型拟合或外部测试。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 2,
      "title": "统一任务与评估口径",
      "sources": "来源：README.md 数据与评估；experiment.py normalize/sample_weights/train_one；crossvalidate.py。不同患者的多眼、多时点图像整组隔离；CV 内另设早停患者。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 3,
      "title": "基线：DINOv3 全局特征＋直接 MLP",
      "sources": "来源：vitb_320/baseline/comparison.json 的 flat.selection/config；extract_vit.py:32-35；experiment.py:96-100,150-168,300-302,366-368。配置 global/flat/h256/dropout0.3，3种子平均概率。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 4,
      "title": "两阶段：把三分类拆成两个二分类任务",
      "sources": "来源：experiment.py routed/tune_thresholds/Model/loss_fn；baseline comparison.json。感染优先选定阈值[0.55,0.30]；正常优先[0.35,0.50]；阈值由开发验证集选择，CV只用内层早停集。外部评价采用硬路由。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 5,
      "title": "M1 模型结构：区域证据＋双层级软融合",
      "sources": "结构严格依据 extract_vit.py:21-35 与 experiment.py:110-117,150-179,254-282,366-379。四路特征768维；区域9×768→9×128；2头区域加性打分softmax池化为256；其余投影256/64/64；拼接640→共享MLP128。直接/感染优先/正常优先三路概率经softmax门控融合。细病种头只作为辅助监督，不参与M1推理融合。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 6,
      "title": "M1 如何计算：局部选择与软层级融合",
      "sources": "来源：experiment.py:265-282,370-379,455-468；M1配置aux0.4、consistency0.3。q的四个sigmoid分量a,b,c,d对应感染、非感染|非感染性集合、异常、感染|异常；BCE使用各真实适用子集掩码。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "title": "M2：将细病种辅助头变成第四个预测分支",
      "sources": "来源：milestone2/selection_before_test.json；subtype_experiments.py；experiment.py:174-182,370-379,455-468。subtype_fusion=true；病种类别映射由拟合患者构建；aux0.6, consistency0.3, subtype_consistency0.1；非后续M4/M5紧凑taxonomy-only结构。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 8,
      "title": "开发集结果：M1 / M2 提升了验证与患者 CV 表现",
      "sources": "来源：baseline comparison.json；milestone1 selection_before_test.json winner.cv/group；milestone2 selection_before_test.json selected/cv。CV标准差来自三折。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 9,
      "title": "外部准确率：M1 两来源提高，M2 的收益不一致",
      "sources": "来源：baseline comparison.json；milestone1/primary/metrics.json；milestone2/primary/metrics.json。图表为PowerPoint原生可编辑图表；y轴从0开始。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 10,
      "title": "为什么不能只看阶段准确率或总体准确率",
      "sources": "来源：baseline comparison.json 各results.image.stage*_accuracy；milestone1/2 primary metrics recall；milestone1 paired_comparison.json；milestone2 paired_external_comparison.json；README.md。M2宁波感染召回67.16%。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 11,
      "title": "M2 的分支诊断：病种汇总承担主要决策权重",
      "sources": "来源：milestone2/selection_before_test.json.subtype_contribution。mean_mixture_weights=[0.0106559163,0.0002415119,0.0003604556,0.9887433052]；with_subtype_branch_removed F1=.81204275；full F1=.83668780；subtype_branch_only与full分类相同。移除诊断使用联合训练权重，不等同于重新训练消融。"
    },
    {
      "slide": 12,
      "title": "四类方法的结论与可追溯来源",
      "sources": "全部数据仅重排既有汇总，不涉及训练或外部评估。完整来源及sha256见同目录source_data.json；可编辑结构图在第5页，PDF/PNG为导出的审阅版本。生成脚本：classification/tools/build_four_methods_ppt.py。"
    }
  ],
